Cascade — third-party license report
=====================================

This file lists every third-party Go module in cascade's dependency graph and
its license, as reported by `go-licenses` against the full module graph
(`go list -m all`). It excludes github.com/acamarata/cascade itself (this
module, not a third party).

Generated by the release pipeline (.goreleaser.yaml `before.hooks`, per
12-QUALITY-CONSTITUTION.md Art.10.1 which re-homes THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES from
repo root to docs/) from the module graph at release time, taking the UNION
across every release GOOS (R-14.1 matrix: darwin, linux, windows) since some
dependencies are platform-conditional (see mousetrap note below). Regenerate
locally with:

    for goos in darwin linux windows; do
      GOOS=$goos go-licenses csv ./... 2>/dev/null
    done | grep -v '^github.com/acamarata/cascade,' | sort -u

